    "13": {
      "text": "<C:0001,0001,><C:0007,0000,><C:0001,0004,>Hai appreso l'<C:0000,0003,00EAFFFF>attacco palla<C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF>!<C:0003,0000,1400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,><C:0007,0000,>Premi <C:0000,0003,FF4F4FFF><C:0000,0002,4B00><C:0000,0002,6400> <C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF>per farla girare e poi ancora\n<C:0000,0002,4B00><C:0000,0003,FF4F4FFF><C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF><C:0000,0002,6400> per scagliarla!<C:0003,0000,1E00><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,><C:0007,0000,>Mentre fai girare la palla, usa il pad\nscorrevole per spostarti su e giù!<C:0003,0000,1E00><C:0003,0001,>",
